2. The PR body's `Clause-②:` line becomes `Clause-②: yes (narrowing)`, and the PR title gains the `!`. The seat makes both edits itself after the push, by one relay stroke.
3. Gates: the changeset families (`check:changeset-*`, the ADR-0087 marker gate) are re-run on the new head and reconciled.

